(7272983, 1132330, 83313, '<td valign="top">This has the look of a Wendy entry. If this is not, please know that is a compliment.</td>', 'This has the look of a Wendy entry. If this is not, please know that is a compliment.', '2014-10-13 01:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
