(7273247, 1132310, 16148, '<td valign="top">A little overexposed but nice toning!  I like how you squared everything up with the phone.</td>', 'A little overexposed but nice toning!  I like how you squared everything up with the phone.', '2014-10-13 18:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273341, 1132246, 13077, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of bunny rabbit shadows on a wall.</td>', 'This reminds me of bunny rabbit shadows on a wall.', '2014-10-13 23:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273343, 1132326, 13077, '<td valign="top">That''s dedication and a good mental attitude!<br/>Nicely done.</td>', 'That''s dedication and a good mental attitude!Nicely done.', '2014-10-13 23:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273345, 1132266, 13077, '<td valign="top">Sharp and well-done photo of the bird, but the whole bird is visible, probably because of the very shallow DOF - I would have suggested a smaller aperture to bring the leaves or fence or whatever that is in front of the bird more into focus and more obscuring, given the topic.<br/>Still, I like the effect and the fact that the head and shoulders of the bird is clear and bright.</td>', 'Sharp and well-done photo of the bird, but the whole bird is visible, probably because of the very shallow DOF - I would have suggested a smaller aperture to bring the leaves or fence or whatever that is in front of the bird more into focus and more obscuring, given the topic.Still, I like the effect and the fact that the head and shoulders of the bird is clear and bright.', '2014-10-13 23:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273346, 1132335, 13077, '<td valign="top">A good concept but I''m not a fan of the single-light setup here - the markings on the wall behind him are still visible although dark, and the shadows don''t really do the uniform any favors although the light does look good on the ball.<br/>Maybe some more ambient light via slower shutter speed would have helped, could be tough to color balance but it is advanced editing.</td>', 'A good concept but I''m not a fan of the single-light setup here - the markings on the wall behind him are still visible although dark, and the shadows don''t really do the uniform any favors although the light does look good on the ball.Maybe some more ambient light via slower shutter speed would have helped, could be tough to color balance but it is advanced editing.', '2014-10-13 23:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273347, 1132315, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very well done - simple, colorful, effective - I even like the fade-to-white around the edges.</td>', 'Very well done - simple, colorful, effective - I even like the fade-to-white around the edges.', '2014-10-13 23:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273348, 1132280, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very visually pleasing, interesting photo. The distorted face and the light are great, as is the negative space and the composition overall.</td>', 'Very visually pleasing, interesting photo. The distorted face and the light are great, as is the negative space and the composition overall.', '2014-10-13 23:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273349, 1132184, 13077, '<td valign="top">Certainly meets the challenge. Leaves the story up the viewer - what sort of van is that? An ice cream vendor? A plumber? A short bus? A church van? Where are they going, and why?</td>', 'Certainly meets the challenge. Leaves the story up the viewer - what sort of van is that? An ice cream vendor? A plumber? A short bus? A church van? Where are they going, and why?', '2014-10-13 23:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273350, 1132148, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like it - well composed, gritty, good tones, good light. Would be strong even without the added border, which I''m not a fan of.</td>', 'I like it - well composed, gritty, good tones, good light. Would be strong even without the added border, which I''m not a fan of.', '2014-10-13 23:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273351, 1132249, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent light and well timed with just a bit of her head breaching the surface. Very mysterious, moody feel because of the light and color tones. Good use of the water for distortion and light fall-off.</td>', 'Excellent light and well timed with just a bit of her head breaching the surface. Very mysterious, moody feel because of the light and color tones. Good use of the water for distortion and light fall-off.', '2014-10-13 23:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273352, 1132309, 13077, '<td valign="top">It''s certainly obscured, and it''s a nice creepy-crawly''s point of view shot.</td>', 'It''s certainly obscured, and it''s a nice creepy-crawly''s point of view shot.', '2014-10-13 23:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273355, 1132226, 13077, '<td valign="top">Beautiful quote and beautiful photo - the only suggestion I have would be to get rid of that soccer goal by repositioning your subject. As-is, it''s very distracting from a simple, colorful and attractive scene.</td>', 'Beautiful quote and beautiful photo - the only suggestion I have would be to get rid of that soccer goal by repositioning your subject. As-is, it''s very distracting from a simple, colorful and attractive scene.', '2014-10-13 23:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273356, 1132230, 30861, '<td valign="top">You are SO gonna win something with this! Great job!</td>', 'You are SO gonna win something with this! Great job!', '2014-10-13 23:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273357, 1132224, 13077, '<td valign="top">Support via lack of support, what a concept. I like the selective coloring here, and the light is dramatic but I think a longer lens from further back would have simplified this and gotten rid of the wide-angle distortion of the window.</td>', 'Support via lack of support, what a concept. I like the selective coloring here, and the light is dramatic but I think a longer lens from further back would have simplified this and gotten rid of the wide-angle distortion of the window.', '2014-10-13 23:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273366, 1132276, 13077, '<td valign="top">The tones look good, but there''s something I find unsettling about this photo. A good moment, mysterious moment and full of contrast and tension between the human elements and the stately, dignified memorial. The thing that''s obscured to me is the story; that is left up to us, the viewer. A difficult riddle that just might remain obscured.<br/>Fascinating.</td>', 'The tones look good, but there''s something I find unsettling about this photo. A good moment, mysterious moment and full of contrast and tension between the human elements and the stately, dignified memorial. The thing that''s obscured to me is the story; that is left up to us, the viewer. A difficult riddle that just might remain obscured.Fascinating.', '2014-10-14 00:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273370, 1132316, 13077, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of the point-and-shooter''s screen here. Excellent photo, it transports us to ''then &amp; there'' which is really two very different times - a chaotic, irreverent modern moment centered around an iconic, very old moment.</td>', 'Wonderful use of the point-and-shooter''s screen here. Excellent photo, it transports us to ''then & there'' which is really two very different times - a chaotic, irreverent modern moment centered around an iconic, very old moment.', '2014-10-14 00:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273428, 1132321, 12611, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. Great line and form.</td>', 'Fantastic. Great line and form.', '2014-10-14 11:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273434, 1132244, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the softness and the title, but what caused that horizontal line about level with her nose?<br/> <br/>Also, I probably would have cropped it tighter, maybe to not even include the strap of her bra or shirt or whatever that is.</td>', 'I like the softness and the title, but what caused that horizontal line about level with her nose? Also, I probably would have cropped it tighter, maybe to not even include the strap of her bra or shirt or whatever that is.', '2014-10-14 11:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273436, 1132284, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and processing. Love the tones and I even like the texture although I usually don''t.</td>', 'Excellent composition and processing. Love the tones and I even like the texture although I usually don''t.', '2014-10-14 11:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273437, 1132208, 13077, '<td valign="top">lol</td>', 'lol', '2014-10-14 11:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273439, 1132209, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like how the cleared portion of the glass is sort of in the shape of a tree.</td>', 'I like how the cleared portion of the glass is sort of in the shape of a tree.', '2014-10-14 12:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273440, 1132268, 13077, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, and a fairly interesting view of the scene.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, and a fairly interesting view of the scene.', '2014-10-14 12:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273441, 1132341, 13077, '<td valign="top">A nice capture, well composed and good tones but I think a little more brightness/contrast applied just to the man''s face and eyes would have helped.</td>', 'A nice capture, well composed and good tones but I think a little more brightness/contrast applied just to the man''s face and eyes would have helped.', '2014-10-14 12:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273442, 1132293, 13077, '<td valign="top">Those look tasty. Nicely arranged I like the negative space and even light.</td>', 'Those look tasty. Nicely arranged I like the negative space and even light.', '2014-10-14 12:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273443, 1132180, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice - meets the challenge well, good composition and colors, and appropriate depth of field.</td>', 'Nice - meets the challenge well, good composition and colors, and appropriate depth of field.', '2014-10-14 12:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273444, 1132314, 13077, '<td valign="top">Although the mountain is obscured by the trees, I find the trees more interesting. Nicely done.</td>', 'Although the mountain is obscured by the trees, I find the trees more interesting. Nicely done.', '2014-10-14 12:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273445, 1132347, 13077, '<td valign="top">Beautifully simple and graphic. I like it.</td>', 'Beautifully simple and graphic. I like it.', '2014-10-14 12:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273446, 1132107, 13077, '<td valign="top">LOL - photobombed!</td>', 'LOL - photobombed!', '2014-10-14 12:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273448, 1132114, 13077, '<td valign="top">Great scene and light, well composed and good processing as well. Meets the challenge and I like it. The line of trees of varying heights in front of the house are beautiful.</td>', 'Great scene and light, well composed and good processing as well. Meets the challenge and I like it. The line of trees of varying heights in front of the house are beautiful.', '2014-10-14 12:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273449, 1132356, 13077, '<td valign="top">lol</td>', 'lol', '2014-10-14 12:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273450, 1132104, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the moody light and composition, but I think the vertical lines of noise are a bit too much. It would still work well with some noise reduction.</td>', 'I like the moody light and composition, but I think the vertical lines of noise are a bit too much. It would still work well with some noise reduction.', '2014-10-14 12:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273451, 1132003, 13077, '<td valign="top">I think it would have worked better with less forehead and more of the peg block thing. Maybe even a horizontal composition from further away.</td>', 'I think it would have worked better with less forehead and more of the peg block thing. Maybe even a horizontal composition from further away.', '2014-10-14 12:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273465, 1132271, 175381, '<td valign="top">This is very nice photograph. <br/>One of the top for me</td>', 'This is very nice photograph. One of the top for me', '2014-10-14 13:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
