(7273691, 1132330, 124815, '<td valign="top">If look can kill (Moriarty?)<br/>Bump</td>', 'If look can kill (Moriarty?)Bump', '2014-10-15 00:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273850, 1132354, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like it. A well done lo-fi still life, perfectly lit for this style, and the way it all obscures the lady exept for her eyes peeking over is charming.</td>', 'I like it. A well done lo-fi still life, perfectly lit for this style, and the way it all obscures the lady exept for her eyes peeking over is charming.', '2014-10-15 12:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273853, 1132263, 13077, '<td valign="top">Interesting harshness and coldness to describe a beach, generally rendered in soft, colorful, and warm tones. The little tent thing is interesting - is a person under there? It seems small from this angle.</td>', 'Interesting harshness and coldness to describe a beach, generally rendered in soft, colorful, and warm tones. The little tent thing is interesting - is a person under there? It seems small from this angle.', '2014-10-15 12:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273877, 1132262, 13077, '<td valign="top">Well captured - fascinating the way he''s hiding behind the banner, and the youth in his eyes and facial expression seem like he personifies the cartoon man in the banner.</td>', 'Well captured - fascinating the way he''s hiding behind the banner, and the youth in his eyes and facial expression seem like he personifies the cartoon man in the banner.', '2014-10-15 12:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273878, 1132310, 13077, '<td valign="top">And the longest title award goes to....<br/>lol<br/>I like the cheerful cell phone cover.</td>', 'And the longest title award goes to....lolI like the cheerful cell phone cover.', '2014-10-15 12:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273886, 1132337, 13077, '<td valign="top">A delightfully tension-filled scene full of obscurity and contrast. I like the old-fashioned hats and the shot glasses in the storefront of the aged building, in contrast to the modern cars outside. It''s all presented in a sort of gritty, what''s-unsaid-is-what-matters fashion, true to the street photography tradition.</td>', 'A delightfully tension-filled scene full of obscurity and contrast. I like the old-fashioned hats and the shot glasses in the storefront of the aged building, in contrast to the modern cars outside. It''s all presented in a sort of gritty, what''s-unsaid-is-what-matters fashion, true to the street photography tradition.', '2014-10-15 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273888, 1132274, 13077, '<td valign="top">I''ll have to take your word for it that they''re blue. While grittiness is becoming of this style of photo, the noise visible here doesn''t quite jive - maybe it''s the way it''s present in the sepia-tinted midtones as well as the tones at the dark end of what''s shown here. Maybe it''s the size of each grain particle. Either way, I think I would have ran noise reduction selectively on the leaves and introduced some grain starting in the darkest areas first, using blending modes and possibly masks.<br/>I do like the composition, and the concept.</td>', 'I''ll have to take your word for it that they''re blue. While grittiness is becoming of this style of photo, the noise visible here doesn''t quite jive - maybe it''s the way it''s present in the sepia-tinted midtones as well as the tones at the dark end of what''s shown here. Maybe it''s the size of each grain particle. Either way, I think I would have ran noise reduction selectively on the leaves and introduced some grain starting in the darkest areas first, using blending modes and possibly masks.I do like the composition, and the concept.', '2014-10-15 13:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273889, 1132281, 13077, '<td valign="top">Good concept, perfect depth of field and excellent composition and tones. Well done.</td>', 'Good concept, perfect depth of field and excellent composition and tones. Well done.', '2014-10-15 13:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273892, 1132108, 13077, '<td valign="top">A good in-flight photo, if slightly out of focus on the subject, combined with an interesting view of the tree. Put the two together and it''s very striking, colorful and meets the challenge well.</td>', 'A good in-flight photo, if slightly out of focus on the subject, combined with an interesting view of the tree. Put the two together and it''s very striking, colorful and meets the challenge well.', '2014-10-15 13:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273906, 1132343, 13077, '<td valign="top">It''s a strong image with good soft light and tones and bold shapes, but weakened by the softness of the dog.</td>', 'It''s a strong image with good soft light and tones and bold shapes, but weakened by the softness of the dog.', '2014-10-15 15:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273924, 1132210, 13077, '<td valign="top">I wonder if all that paint keeps them dry...</td>', 'I wonder if all that paint keeps them dry...', '2014-10-15 15:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273925, 1132271, 13077, '<td valign="top">I wonder what the focal length for this one was? Good capture, and meets the challenge, but I probably would have cropped away some of the negative space at the bottom.</td>', 'I wonder what the focal length for this one was? Good capture, and meets the challenge, but I probably would have cropped away some of the negative space at the bottom.', '2014-10-15 15:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273931, 1132217, 13077, '<td valign="top">It''s a good location and pose, and pleasant lighting, but something about the way the dress is flying is a bit unsettling to me. Maybe if it were whipping to the side, and not flying out of the top of the frame, it would work better?</td>', 'It''s a good location and pose, and pleasant lighting, but something about the way the dress is flying is a bit unsettling to me. Maybe if it were whipping to the side, and not flying out of the top of the frame, it would work better?', '2014-10-15 16:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273932, 1132342, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very striking. I like the contrast between chaos and tranquility, and the composition is very strong and visually pleasing.</td>', 'Very striking. I like the contrast between chaos and tranquility, and the composition is very strong and visually pleasing.', '2014-10-15 16:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273933, 1131903, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed, good moment and light - strikes me as a predator''s point of view, maybe a mountain lion ready to rush out and take down the deer.</td>', 'Nicely framed, good moment and light - strikes me as a predator''s point of view, maybe a mountain lion ready to rush out and take down the deer.', '2014-10-15 16:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273940, 1132254, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the light play and shadows and shapes here. It all works well together.</td>', 'I like the light play and shadows and shapes here. It all works well together.', '2014-10-15 16:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273941, 1132300, 13077, '<td valign="top">It''s certainly obscured, but I don''t find the composition very appealing.</td>', 'It''s certainly obscured, but I don''t find the composition very appealing.', '2014-10-15 16:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273943, 1132015, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like how all the elements of this visually came together when presented from this angle. It''s cute how the little bird almost looks like it''s sitting on his hardhat at first.</td>', 'I like how all the elements of this visually came together when presented from this angle. It''s cute how the little bird almost looks like it''s sitting on his hardhat at first.', '2014-10-15 16:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273944, 1132140, 13077, '<td valign="top">It''s a good pose captured, and ''obscured'' is certainly one of the main themes of the photo, but it''s very low in contrast and I think it would have looked better with a levels adjustment.</td>', 'It''s a good pose captured, and ''obscured'' is certainly one of the main themes of the photo, but it''s very low in contrast and I think it would have looked better with a levels adjustment.', '2014-10-15 16:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273946, 1132064, 13077, '<td valign="top">Cool. Nicely done, has a sort of painting feel.</td>', 'Cool. Nicely done, has a sort of painting feel.', '2014-10-15 16:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273952, 1132049, 13077, '<td valign="top">It''s nicely framed and composed, but there seems to be either a lot of noise reduction or jpeg artifacts taking their toll on the sharpness and detail.</td>', 'It''s nicely framed and composed, but there seems to be either a lot of noise reduction or jpeg artifacts taking their toll on the sharpness and detail.', '2014-10-15 16:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273954, 1132082, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity and the mysteriousness here.</td>', 'I like the simplicity and the mysteriousness here.', '2014-10-15 16:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273956, 1132265, 13077, '<td valign="top">It''s a cool concept, and the subtlety of the way the face is visible is nice, but I think I would have preferred a smooth cloth or possibly having the embroidered side where the shadow is.</td>', 'It''s a cool concept, and the subtlety of the way the face is visible is nice, but I think I would have preferred a smooth cloth or possibly having the embroidered side where the shadow is.', '2014-10-15 16:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273957, 1132167, 13077, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the processing or the composition of this one, but it is a nice find.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the processing or the composition of this one, but it is a nice find.', '2014-10-15 16:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273958, 1132320, 13077, '<td valign="top">I keep expecting one of those shadows to become a ghost and pop out at me.</td>', 'I keep expecting one of those shadows to become a ghost and pop out at me.', '2014-10-15 16:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273960, 1132294, 13077, '<td valign="top">Cute, simple, and a fairly clean background. I might have suggested moving closer to the tree on the left and positioning the camera to bring the trees closer together where the girl fills more of the void, but that''s nitpicking...</td>', 'Cute, simple, and a fairly clean background. I might have suggested moving closer to the tree on the left and positioning the camera to bring the trees closer together where the girl fills more of the void, but that''s nitpicking...', '2014-10-15 16:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
