(7274139, 1132184, 30364, '<td valign="top">Oh no, not you again.  Well, the title is apt not just for this picture but for your whole lot as one big fat slippery<br/> joyful bundle.  It''s a 7+ from me, as ever.  Thank you.</td>', 'Oh no, not you again.  Well, the title is apt not just for this picture but for your whole lot as one big fat slippery joyful bundle.  It''s a 7+ from me, as ever.  Thank you.', '2014-10-16 10:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274141, 1132246, 30364, '<td valign="top">Simple but interesting.  And it''s a wee tribute to photography itself as well.  So <i>not</i> boring, which makes it an automatic 7+ score from me.  Thank you.</td>', 'Simple but interesting.  And it''s a wee tribute to photography itself as well.  So not boring, which makes it an automatic 7+ score from me.  Thank you.', '2014-10-16 10:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274143, 1132352, 30364, '<td valign="top">More than one bite of the obscura biscuit here, and each bite delicious too.  Into my 7+ score gallery.  Thank you.</td>', 'More than one bite of the obscura biscuit here, and each bite delicious too.  Into my 7+ score gallery.  Thank you.', '2014-10-16 11:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274144, 1132230, 30364, '<td valign="top">Seems like you have been photobombed by René Magritte.  Thanks to you both for a very interesting, amusing photograph.  Into my 7+ selections you go, and you can take that René fellow with you as well.  If he behaves himself.</td>', 'Seems like you have been photobombed by René Magritte.  Thanks to you both for a very interesting, amusing photograph.  Into my 7+ selections you go, and you can take that René fellow with you as well.  If he behaves himself.', '2014-10-16 11:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274147, 1132284, 30364, '<td valign="top">I had to look it up.  I think it means <i>pissing down</i>?  Sounds much more fun your way though, and it''s a very interesting, lively, anti-boring picture as well.  It''s definitely a 7+ from me.  <i>Go raibh maith agat.</i>  (I had to look that up, as well)</td>', 'I had to look it up.  I think it means pissing down?  Sounds much more fun your way though, and it''s a very interesting, lively, anti-boring picture as well.  It''s definitely a 7+ from me.  Go raibh maith agat.  (I had to look that up, as well)', '2014-10-16 11:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274149, 1132337, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nearly falls apart, but then the disembodied hand somehow holds everything together.  <br/> <br/>I love street photography above all other kinds, and I have to say this is immensely ambitious because it''s not quite as sharply observed as the classics of the genre (which tend to share a lot in common with good political or social commentary cartoons).  <br/> <br/>Your picture is more sophisticated and demanding, and probably no better off for that!  But the fabulous hand rescues you from obscurity and confusion.  Now I wish I could insert a hand in this comment somewhere, to perform the same rescue service for me.  Maybe posthumous will give you one.  I''m giving you a 7+ score and a thank you.</td>', 'Nearly falls apart, but then the disembodied hand somehow holds everything together.   I love street photography above all other kinds, and I have to say this is immensely ambitious because it''s not quite as sharply observed as the classics of the genre (which tend to share a lot in common with good political or social commentary cartoons).   Your picture is more sophisticated and demanding, and probably no better off for that!  But the fabulous hand rescues you from obscurity and confusion.  Now I wish I could insert a hand in this comment somewhere, to perform the same rescue service for me.  Maybe posthumous will give you one.  I''m giving you a 7+ score and a thank you.', '2014-10-16 11:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274165, 1132262, 30364, '<td valign="top">Yes.  Salut! ... from one lover of street photography to another (and there''s no question about that) ... it''s a wonderful street shot right from the modern classic school.  Beautifully observed, and perfectly rendered (by which I mean you didn''t f**k it up with too much damn photography).  10, thank you, and the dreaded Order of the Thumb as well.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=800078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Yes.  Salut! ... from one lover of street photography to another (and there''s no question about that) ... it''s a wonderful street shot right from the modern classic school.  Beautifully observed, and perfectly rendered (by which I mean you didn''t f**k it up with too much damn photography).  10, thank you, and the dreaded Order of the Thumb as well.', '2014-10-16 11:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7274185, 1132070, 30364, '<td valign="top">Quite beautiful.  You demonstrate great respect and affection for the photograph as well as for the subject.  10.  Thank you.  You''re also stuck with an Order of the Thumb, and no returns allowed I''m afraid.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=800078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Quite beautiful.  You demonstrate great respect and affection for the photograph as well as for the subject.  10.  Thank you.  You''re also stuck with an Order of the Thumb, and no returns allowed I''m afraid.', '2014-10-16 12:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
