(7275006, 1132357, 124982, '<td valign="top">Such a simple image (not a bad thing!), but has it''s appeal in the minimalist approach. Such a lovely shot, very soft and warm and appealing. Makes me wish I had a picnic cloth on the ground and lying on that bank watching the sunset/sunrise. Top 5 for me!</td>', 'Such a simple image (not a bad thing!), but has it''s appeal in the minimalist approach. Such a lovely shot, very soft and warm and appealing. Makes me wish I had a picnic cloth on the ground and lying on that bank watching the sunset/sunrise. Top 5 for me!', '2014-10-18 18:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275009, 1132265, 124982, '<td valign="top">Elegantly done. Very soft and feathery processing. Can''t make up my mind if the embroidery adds or subtracts from the shot? Nonetheless, one of my top scores!</td>', 'Elegantly done. Very soft and feathery processing. Can''t make up my mind if the embroidery adds or subtracts from the shot? Nonetheless, one of my top scores!', '2014-10-18 18:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275012, 1132224, 124982, '<td valign="top">I''m 100% behind setting them free! 10/13/14 is my new favorite day of the year!<br/> <br/>Joking aside, lovely image and nice sillhouette. Selective sat/desat is a little gimmicky, but it works.</td>', 'I''m 100% behind setting them free! 10/13/14 is my new favorite day of the year! Joking aside, lovely image and nice sillhouette. Selective sat/desat is a little gimmicky, but it works.', '2014-10-18 18:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275014, 1132217, 124982, '<td valign="top">Love the sense of motion and the pose! Lovely splash of color too!! Two critiques I have are the choice of background (a little bland when you consider the subject), and the weird color cast on her outstretched arm (too dramatic a transition in color and exposure)</td>', 'Love the sense of motion and the pose! Lovely splash of color too!! Two critiques I have are the choice of background (a little bland when you consider the subject), and the weird color cast on her outstretched arm (too dramatic a transition in color and exposure)', '2014-10-18 18:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7275015, 1132049, 124982, '<td valign="top">Excellent timing and well caught!!</td>', 'Excellent timing and well caught!!', '2014-10-18 18:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
