(7275642, 1131903, 60173, '<td valign="top">Terrible score for a lovely image. It''s crisp, clean, and has pleasant lighting.<br/> <br/>I took a shot very similar to this of an elk, but I couldn''t get the processing right. I ended up submitting a different one, that I also knew wouldn''t score well, but I liked it better. When I saw yours in voting, I said, "Phew! Glad I didn''t enter that other one." Yours is much better than the one I left on the cutting room floor. It very much deserves to have broken the 6.0 mark.</td>', 'Terrible score for a lovely image. It''s crisp, clean, and has pleasant lighting. I took a shot very similar to this of an elk, but I couldn''t get the processing right. I ended up submitting a different one, that I also knew wouldn''t score well, but I liked it better. When I saw yours in voting, I said, "Phew! Glad I didn''t enter that other one." Yours is much better than the one I left on the cutting room floor. It very much deserves to have broken the 6.0 mark.', '2014-10-21 14:11:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7275747, 1132358, 68503, '<td valign="top">This was a cool shot Mark with the image in the background obscuring his face as well.</td>', 'This was a cool shot Mark with the image in the background obscuring his face as well.', '2014-10-21 21:40:14.000000', NULL, 0),
