(7275881, 1132262, 112739, '<td valign="top">It''s such a nice thing to have to wait for this image to come together. Then to be rewarded with still an incomplete story. Thanks Jon.</td>', 'It''s such a nice thing to have to wait for this image to come together. Then to be rewarded with still an incomplete story. Thanks Jon.', '2014-10-22 00:04:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7275882, 1132217, 121111, '<td valign="top">The picture was going to be deleted ,because the cloth flew in front of her ... <br/> <br/>that gave the shade to her arm , along with the weird color<br/> <br/>but the challenge came along and decided to submit it<br/> <br/>thanks for the comments!!!</td>', 'The picture was going to be deleted ,because the cloth flew in front of her ...  that gave the shade to her arm , along with the weird color but the challenge came along and decided to submit it thanks for the comments!!!', '2014-10-22 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7275884, 1132337, 112739, '<td valign="top">I also have to agree with the comments of Paul. First look feels quite cluttered and the elements appear to be alone and without cohesion. Then the obscured mothers gaze and the hand bring it all together.</td>', 'I also have to agree with the comments of Paul. First look feels quite cluttered and the elements appear to be alone and without cohesion. Then the obscured mothers gaze and the hand bring it all together.', '2014-10-22 00:08:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(7275887, 1132276, 112739, '<td valign="top">Not sure which blast is the past. Good stuff.</td>', 'Not sure which blast is the past. Good stuff.', '2014-10-22 00:11:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7276092, 1132070, 30861, '<td valign="top">"Oh, 800 pixels is dark ages compared to full details in this image. PLEASE PLEASE PLEASE can this site come into the 21st century and go to 1200? "<br/> <br/>Your wish is granted, sir! Wonderful portrait, also :-)</td>', '"Oh, 800 pixels is dark ages compared to full details in this image. PLEASE PLEASE PLEASE can this site come into the 21st century and go to 1200? " Your wish is granted, sir! Wonderful portrait, also :-)', '2014-10-22 12:03:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7276271, 1132334, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>1st I''ll explain what I like: I love the framing. The trees frame the elk nicely. I also like the amount of detail in the trees and grass. Your focus is spot on.... <br/> <br/>OK there is only 1 thing that I really think hurts this pic. Lighting. The light in the background I find too harsh. (I am sure this was taken in mid day). I did not vote in this challenge but I would have given you a 5.<br/> <br/>Overall nice shot. Keep shooting</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... 1st I''ll explain what I like: I love the framing. The trees frame the elk nicely. I also like the amount of detail in the trees and grass. Your focus is spot on....  OK there is only 1 thing that I really think hurts this pic. Lighting. The light in the background I find too harsh. (I am sure this was taken in mid day). I did not vote in this challenge but I would have given you a 5. Overall nice shot. Keep shooting', '2014-10-22 20:49:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7276283, 1132070, 112739, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bear_Music:</b></div><hr/><i> "Oh, 800 pixels is dark ages compared to full details in this image. PLEASE PLEASE PLEASE can this site come into the 21st century and go to 1200? "<br/> <br/>Your wish is granted, sir! Wonderful portrait, also :-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I was flabbergasted to see the reality of the thread from Langdon! I just couldn''t believe it. What a huge improvement from my POV.</td>', 'Originally posted by Bear_Music: "Oh, 800 pixels is dark ages compared to full details in this image. PLEASE PLEASE PLEASE can this site come into the 21st century and go to 1200? " Your wish is granted, sir! Wonderful portrait, also :-)   I was flabbergasted to see the reality of the thread from Langdon! I just couldn''t believe it. What a huge improvement from my POV.', '2014-10-22 22:32:21.000000', NULL, 0),
